      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="effective-date">Effective Date: January 1, 2026 | Last Updated: August 22, 2026</div>

      <p>This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Odoo Reconciler</strong> ("we", "us", or "our"), hosted at <code>app.urbanvibeinteriordesign.co.ke</code>, collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our web application and connected Google Gemini AI integration.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect and process only the data necessary to provide our invoice extraction, financial reconciliation, and shop floor management services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Name, email address, and authentication credentials used to access the application.</li>
        <li><strong>Business & Financial Data:</strong> Purchase orders, vendor invoices, job summary PDFs, and M-Pesa transaction records uploaded or imported for processing.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Account Data:</strong> When you connect via Google Gemini OAuth, we access your Google Cloud Generative Language API scope strictly to process text and document OCR extractions on your behalf. We do not access your personal Gmail, Google Drive files, or contacts.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the collected information solely for business operational purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To extract structured financial data from uploaded documents and PDFs using Gemini AI and OCR tools.</li>
        <li>To automate Purchase Order and Vendor Bill matching with Odoo ERP.</li>
        <li>To perform M-Pesa transaction categorization and financial reconciliation.</li>
        <li>To maintain app security, user authentication, and system operation logs.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Data Protection & Sharing</h2>
      <p>We prioritize the security of your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No Data Sales:</strong> We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal or business data to third parties or advertisers.</li>
        <li><strong>Third-Party AI Services:</strong> When AI extraction is enabled, document text is securely submitted to Google Gemini API for real-time extraction. Google Cloud complies with standard enterprise privacy requirements.</li>
        <li><strong>Security Controls:</strong> API keys and OAuth tokens are stored in encrypted format on secure servers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. User Rights & Data Retention</h2>
      <p>You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your stored account data. You may disconnect the Google Gemini OAuth connection at any time through the application Settings panel.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our administrator at:<br />
      Email: <code>dbadmin@urbanvibeinteriordesign.co.ke</code><br />
      Website: <code>app.urbanvibeinteriordesign.co.ke</code></p>

